description = "A libretro port of UZDoom, a modern, feature-rich source port of the classic DOOM engine and a continuation of ZDoom and GZDoom. UZDoom supports DOOM, DOOM II, Final DOOM and numerous custom games and modifications. Features include high-resolution graphics, dynamic lighting, 3D floors, advanced scripting, extensive modding capabilities and modern OpenGL and Vulkan rendering."
